      "updated": 1753756208911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "parse_tab is a function that will \ntake a list of strings, and it will\nturn them into a lists of lists.\n\nEx:\n```\nline1\n-> line2\n-> -> line3\n-> line4\n```\nOutput\n```\n[\n    \"line1\",\n    [\n        \"line2\",\n        [\n            \"line3\"\n        ]\n        \"line4\"\n    ]\n]\n```",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "_19_RZAhii_g0uyBcNwpr",
      "originalText": "parse_tab is a function that will \ntake a list of strings, and it will\nturn them into a lists of lists.\n\nEx:\n```\nline1\n-> line2\n-> -> line3\n-> line4\n```\nOutput\n```\n[\n    \"line1\",\n    [\n        \"line2\",\n        [\n            \"line3\"\n        ]\n        \"line4\"\n    ]\n]\n```",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
